<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 87,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 87,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Monday were 87,000 head, compared with the estimate of 100,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50-$1.00 per cwt higher than midsession Monday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    54.00 -55.00	   55.00 -56.00</p>
<p>few			53.50  55.50	   54.50  56.50</p>
<p>Sows:  mostly steady except 500 lbs up steady to 1.00 higher.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  43.00 -46.00	   44.00 -47.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -47.00	   45.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    46.00 -49.00	   47.00 -50.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
